@startuml
hide empty description
[*] --> PENDING : Order created by checkout
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : OrderService.confirm
PENDING --> CANCELLED : cancel / cancelByCustomer
CONFIRMED --> SHIPPING : startDelivery
SHIPPING --> DELIVERED : markDelivered
DELIVERED --> COMPLETED : confirmReceipt by owner
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of CONFIRMED
  Separate BANKING confirmation path:
  PaymentTransactionService.confirmPaymentByAdmin
  sets the order to CONFIRMED without checking
  the order's prior status.
end note

note bottom of CANCELLED
  Cancellation methods accept PENDING only
  and restore inventory.
end note
@enduml
